@startuml
title Aveli — RevenueCat Subscription Integration

actor User
participant "Aveli Mobile" as Mobile
participant "RevenueCat SDK" as RCSDK
participant "Apple / Google Store" as Store
participant "Aveli Backend" as Backend
participant "RevenueCat REST" as RCREST
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> Mobile : purchase / restore
Mobile -> RCSDK : offerings / purchase / restore
RCSDK -> Store : store billing flow
Store --> RCSDK : provider result
RCSDK --> Mobile : CustomerInfo / outcome

Mobile -> Backend : POST /v1/billing/sync\nBearer JWT
Backend -> RCREST : GET subscriber/{userId}
RCREST --> Backend : subscription evidence
Backend -> DB : upsert normalized subscription
Backend -> DB : resolve access sources
Backend --> Mobile : AccessStatusView

note right of Mobile
CustomerInfo does not
directly unlock workspace.
end note

@enduml
